   9:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdatadst.c ****  * This file contains compression data destination routines for the case of
  10:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdatadst.c ****  * emitting JPEG data to memory or to a file (or any stdio stream).
