  14:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdatadst.c ****  * JOCTETs into 8-bit-wide elements on external storage.  If char is wider
  15:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jdatadst.c ****  * than 8 bits on your machine, you may need to do some tweaking.
